      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就如同训练员可以按他们的价值基准来判断赛马娘一样，\n咱们赛马娘也有自己的选择权。对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73eea507b78be936c225948fe293660dcede6445b77fa160d739a3bebd58ec70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
