    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d07f2798653e90cb43d354db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。一边说着『不管了』『随你便』一边给我忠告……\n呵，神宫君还是那么愉快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "580a6b041b97af5bae3a96236690908474f2e5867d67b765d536204e97aa6f63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032002.json",
