    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd51faa50f99a15c6abe5c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道你是主动来给我当实验品的吗！？\n多么美妙的豚鼠精神！　只能说是令人佩服啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "670a396fc2b23e0854c0bf58c6cce55d05ce161d496abdff08b4aac0c2a038fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d106870a7c86d3a700de68c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我拼命反驳着兴奋的爱丽速子，\n解释自己是来劝她参加选拔赛的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6afa42c19cbbd3951af4cc27a862f1ae155d7216828ebe9d78a85f56ff5f4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032002.json",
      "json_path": [
