    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bc990faa544ce1dfaea82ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进一步说就是“藏在马娘这种生物肉体里的可能性”、\n也就是“最快的速度”――不，应该是“最快的更前方”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a1c7ed799f810f7c8ca3cf0e5b329c224856f0fd147a146d1dc1c924d69813",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
