      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "它的存在虽然早已被视为理所当然，\n但一切常识都是发现的敌人。因此排除常识考虑的话――",
      "source_fingerprint": "59067f9827dddf59c2e0207827908901516c4b76283877f63cff2e07b2036f78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
