      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别是奔跑能力，即便放在动物界也很突出，\n速度在所有种族中也是名列前茅――",
      "source_fingerprint": "056076b9cfbe27d2f4d297e9de78c26832393206e101bbc29da50bdc1fd6370b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
