      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，我大脑里充斥的冲动很简单。\n『我们能快到何种地步！？』『这种可能性的极限有多大！？』",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5b52ded2a13af29ff11d8af32083ac5fbcefa0264cc6d687fdd8b9aee57b3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
